      "message": "Merge main e313aa663 into issue/3354-pocket-pass-start (#3354)\n\nMerged origin/main e313aa663, the #3353 merge, into the branch.\n\nThe #3353 merge replaced PassStart::rank (removed by the #3494 review)\nwith the StartSide / level-rings law, so the branch did not compile.\n\nFixes:\n- crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs: keep both export lists - the\n  #3354 Pocket notes and constants, and StartSide, pocket_started_on and\n  pocket_avoid_started_on from main.\n- crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs: the Zigzag note reads\n  side.start, the parameter of pocket_over_with_relief in the new law,\n  not the removed start binding.\n- The #3354 constants PASS_START_ZIGZAG_NOTE and PASS_START_REST_NOTE\n  merged beside the new StartSide law. Auto stays byte for byte, and\n  Inside/Outside keep the Pocket ring order.\n\nRefs #3354\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
